{"type":"message","id":"5c1f13fc","parentId":"87ae3ea7","timestamp":"2026-04-18T23:00:55.513Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The output shows 7 items from the Notion daily briefing. All items seem to be categorized as \"N/A\" which is unusual. Let me analyze the content:\n\n1. Security - Brewassets access request approval notification (Delivered status)\n2. Infrastructure - MGMTNATPAKRNP NAT VM patch completed, requesting post-check\n3. Infrastructure - FTP & Talk AP servers Windows OS upgrade completed (2016 → 2022)\n4. Security - Brewassets access request approval notification (Queued status)\n5. Infrastructure - Netskope VM upgrade rollback due to compatibility issues, new server build proposed\n6. Security - Brewassets access request completed (RITM19689685), satisfaction survey\n7. Infrastructure - Korea non-op server patch completed, requesting system check\n\nThe categories are showing as \"N/A\" but I can see from the actual content that they are Security and Infrastructure related. Let me create a concise Korean briefing based on this content.\n\nCategory counts:\n- Security: 3 items\n- Infrastructure: 4 items\n- Total: 7 items\n\nImmediate actions needed:\n- Check for issues on patched VMs (item 2, 7)\n- Follow up on Netskope VM rollback/new server build plan (item 5)\n\nLet me create a concise Korean briefing under 3500 characters.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"# 📅 노션 일일 브리핑 (04/18 07:00 ~ 04/19 07:00)\n\n**📊 요약:** 총 7건 (Infrastructure: 4, Security: 3)\n\n---\n\n## 🔥 즉시 조치 필요\n\n1. **[Infrastructure] MGMTNATPAKRNP NAT VM 패치 완료**\n   - 보안 방화벽 팀 사후 점검 필요\n   - 이슈 발생 시 피드백 요청됨\n\n2. **[Infrastructure] Netskope VM 업그레이드 롤백**\n   - 애플리케이션 호환성 문제 발생\n   - 신규 서버 구축 해결방안 제안됨 - 후속 계획 확인 필요\n\n3. **[Infrastructure] 한국 비운영 서버 패치 완료**\n   - 시스템 점검 수행 필요\n\n---\n\n## 📋 일반 업무\n\n4. **[Security] Brewassets 액세스 승인 (Delivered)**\n   - RITM 완료 상태\n\n5. **[Security] Brewassets 액세스 승인 (Queued)**\n   - 대기 중 상태\n\n6. **[Infrastructure] FTP/Talk AP 서버 OS 업그레이드 완료**\n   - Windows 2016 → 2022 성공\n\n7. **[Security] Brewassets 액세스 완료 (RITM19689685)**\n   - 서비스 만족도 조사 요청\n\n---\n\n**⚡ 즉시 조치:**\n- 3대 패치 완료 서버 점검 (NAT VM, 비운영 서버)\n- Netskope VM 신규 서버 구축 계획 확인"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":795,"output":968,"cacheRead":16073,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":17836,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776553234279,"responseId":"20260419070037999d86283a8347fb"}}
